.PS
# regress/jfet_amp.cir drawn: an n-JFET common-source stage (VTO -2,
# BETA 1.3m) with 4.7k drain load and 100 ohm source degeneration,
# driven through 10k; the 1.5 V sine pushes the gate into forward
# conduction on its crests. Card order kept; deck nodes 1 Vp, 5 In,
# 2 Vg, 3 Vd, 4 Vs.
spice = 1
Vp: (4.4,3.2)
In: (0.3,1.5)
Vg: (2.3,1.5)
Vd: (2.86,2.3)
Vs: (2.86,1.14)

Vdd: vsource(Vp, (4.4,0), dc 15, "VDD")
Vin: vsource(In, (0.3,0), dc 0 ac 1 sin(0 1.5 1meg), "G₁")
Rsig: resistor(In, Vg, 10k)
J1: njfet((2.7,1.5), jn, "T₁")
RD: resistor((2.86,3.2), Vd, 4.7k)
RS: resistor(Vs, (2.86,0), 100)

line from RD.N to J1.D
line from RD.P to Vdd.P
line from Vin.N to Vdd.N
line from Vd to (3.6,2.3); circle rad 0.04 at (3.64,2.3)
"out" above at (3.64,2.35)
dot at Vd; dot at RS.N
ground((1.5,0))
.model jn njf vto=-2 beta=1.3e-3 lambda=0.01 rd=20 rs=15 cgs=3p cgd=1.5p
+ pb=0.8 is=2e-14 b=0.95
.ac dec 10 1k 1g
.op
.tran 10n 3u
.PE
